  "term": "schooling",
  "definition": "Schooling is the organized provision of school education, including either direct placement in regular schools or a temporary preparatory school setting before entry into mainstream education. In this context, it is described not only as academic placement but also as a source of daily structure, normality, hope, and resilience for children after major disruption.",
